    "Autocorrelation and clustered errors",
    "Multicollinearity and specification",
    "Endogeneity: omitted variables, simultaneity, measurement error",
    "Instrumental variables and two-stage least squares",
    "Panel data: fixed and random effects",
    "Difference-in-differences (introduction)",
    "Maximum likelihood estimation",
    "Binary and multinomial choice (logit, probit)",
    "Limited dependent variables (Tobit, censoring)",
    "Generalized method of moments (overview)",
